    6. Place frames on grid with >=1 bg gap between bounding boxes and >=1 from grid edges;
       use greedy or random placement with rejection
    7. Build output grid: draw each frame lattice, fill ALL slots with their assigned color
    8. Derive input: copy output, then for each frame, clear (set to bg) every slot that is NOT
